    "description": "The Fitness Memberships History API provides access to a comprehensive history of fitness membership transactions for users. This endpoint allows consumers, such as fitness centers and service providers, to retrieve detailed records of past memberships, enabling more effective customer management and personalized service offerings. Typical use cases include analyzing membership trends, generating reports on past memberships, and enhancing customer engagement through targeted communication. Developers can leverage this API to integrate historical data into user interfaces or analytics platforms.",
